设$X_1，X_2，\ldots,X_{10}$是取自正态总体$N\left(2，\sigma^2\right)$的样本，记$\bar{X}=\frac{1}{10}\sum_{i=1}^{10}X_i,\mathrm{~S}=\sqrt{\frac{1}{9}\sum_{i=1}^{10}\left(X_i-\bar{X}\right)^2}$,已知$P\left(\bar{X}\leqslant2,S^2\leqslant\sigma^2\right)=\frac{1}{5}$，则$\mathrm{P}(\mathrm{S}\leq\sigma)$的值为____
