设二维随机向量$(X,Y)$的联合概率密度为$f(x,y)=\begin{cases}k,&0<x<1,x^2<y<1\text{;}\\0,&\text{其他}\end{cases}$其中$k>0$为常数，下例结论正确的为:____
A. $$
f_X(x)=\left\{\begin{array}{l}
k\left(1-x^2\right), 0<x<1, \\
0, \quad \text { 其他. }
\end{array} ; f_Y(y)=\left\{\begin{array}{l}
k \sqrt{y}, 0<y<1, \\
0, \quad \text { 其他. }
\end{array}\right.\right.
$$
B. $$
f_X(x)=\left\{\begin{array}{l}
k\left(x^2-1\right), 0<x<1, \\
0, \quad \text { 其他 }
\end{array} ; f_Y(y)=\left\{\begin{array}{l}
k \sqrt{y}, 0<y<1, \\
0, \quad \text { 其他 }
\end{array}\right.\right.
$$
C. $$
f_X(x)=\left\{\begin{array}{l}
k\left(1-y^2\right), 0<x<1, \\
0, \quad \text { 其他 }
\end{array} ; f_Y(y)=\left\{\begin{array}{l}
k \sqrt{x}, 0<y<1, \\
0, \quad \text { 其他 }
\end{array}\right.\right.
$$
D. $$
f_X(x)=\left\{\begin{array}{l}
\left(1-x^2\right), 0<x<1, \\
0, \quad \text { 其他 }
\end{array} ; f_Y(y)=\left\{\begin{array}{l}
k \sqrt{y}, 0<y<1, \\
0, \quad \text { 其他 }
\end{array}\right.\right.
$$

answer:
A. $$
f_X(x)=\left\{\begin{array}{l}
k\left(1-x^2\right), 0<x<1, \\
0, \quad \text { 其他. }
\end{array} ; f_Y(y)=\left\{\begin{array}{l}
k \sqrt{y}, 0<y<1, \\
0, \quad \text { 其他. }
\end{array}\right.\right.
$$

question_text:
设总体X服从参数为$\lambda(\lambda>0)$的泊松分布，$X_1，X_2，\ldots,X$n为来自总体X的简单随机样本.记$\bar{X}=\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^nX_i$，$T=a\bar{X}+(\bar{X})^2$，其中$a$为常数.若$\mathrm{E}(T)=\lambda^2$，则a=____
A. -\frac{1}{n}
B. \frac{1}{n}
C. -1
D. 1

